The patches in this directory alter DXMT (https://github.com/3Shain/dxmt)
and are offered under DXMT's own license, the MIT License, which follows as
DXMT publishes it. All four are DXMT's own commits, made after the v0.80
release that Meridian builds: a741a3f and d815f7f (0001, 0002: memory leaks),
0606575 (0003: Xcode 27's Metal compiler) and 75bd4da (0004: GCC 15).

